@title: shop_help_links
@context: The same Help link in the header and the footer, each answering for itself.
@tags: shop
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the shop
    NAVIGATE to 'Shop'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Shop'

STEP 2: Help from the header
    CLICK the 'Help' link ON HEADER
    VERIFY that 'Help from the header' is present

STEP 3: Help from the footer
    CLICK the 'Help' link ON FOOTER
    VERIFY that 'Help from the footer' is present
    VERIFY that 'Help from the header' is NOT present

STEP 4: A product
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR 'Manul Plush'
    VERIFY that 'Added Manul Plush' is present

STEP 5: Help replaces it
    CLICK the 'Help' link ON HEADER
    VERIFY that 'Help from the header' is present
    VERIFY that 'Added Manul Plush' is NOT present

STEP 6: The footer once more
    CLICK the 'Help' link ON FOOTER
    VERIFY that 'Help from the footer' is present

STEP 7: An edit replaces that
    CLICK the 'Edit' button INSIDE 'Team' row with 'Alan Turing'
    VERIFY that 'Editing Alan Turing' is present
    VERIFY that 'Help from the footer' is NOT present

DONE.
